WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.140
My name is Yamamura Kazuya.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.240
Right now, I am violently nervous!

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:11.530
Yes! And it's because I am finally 
able to meet with the one I idolize!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.150
Please, wait!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.510
Oga-san, please listen!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.220
Please accept me as your 
sworn little brother!

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.760
Please!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.490
Whatcha lookin' at?! I'll bust you up!

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:27.860
Something's off...

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.670
Like this?

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:30.670
No...

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.710
Or maybe... like this?!

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.920
My name is Yamamura Kazuya.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.790
I attend St. Ishiyama Academy 
as a first-year student.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:41.110
I am currently training to be a delinquent.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:45.740
The guys in class laughed at me when 
I came out during summer break.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.000
They can talk all they want.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.830
Because I've decided to change myself!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.770
That's right! I'll make myself stronger!

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.580
This is Oga-san's house.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.780
It's a lot more normal than I thought.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:05.290
<b>Oga</b>

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.330
Honestly, I thought it'd be more like this.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.450
Maybe his family is actually pretty normal?

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.610
No-no... I shouldn't let down my guard.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.590
Who knows what monsters might show up!

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.070
Yeah... Looks like I need 
to mentally prepare myself.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.060
Yes, coming!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.210
Now <i>this</i> was unexpected!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.440
<b>She cometh! She cometh! She cometh!</b>

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.320
And who might you be?

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.690
G-Good morning...

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.960
<b>May I Call You Brother?</b>

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.410
It is a pleasure to meet you, Sister.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.360
My name is Yamamura Kazuya 
and starting today,

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.810
I shall take the role of 
Oga-san's sworn little brother!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.110
You are Oga-san's wife, are you not? I 
am pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.470
Sworn little brother?

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.350
You seriously came here?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.630
Oga-san, I have come to walk you to school!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.140
Sworn little brother... 
You serve him then, yes?

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.440
It looks like you've moved up in the world!

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.560
That ain't it.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.450
Have a lovely day!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.640
Thank you!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.250
What the heck...

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.340
Brother, you are so incredible!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.110
To think your wife would be a foreigner!

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.650
And she's an incredibly busty beauty!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.340
Oh! Let me carry your bag.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.350
Now, see here... I've been 
telling you since yesterday.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.640
I ain't your brother or whatever, 
so stop following me!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.850
Don't be like that.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.990
Please wait, Brother!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.320
Man, what's with him?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.140
He's taken a pretty creepy liking to me...

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:06.170
I don't need any <i>less</i> freedom!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.260
Look here, uh...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.710
Oh, call me Kazu!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.990
What year are you, Kazu?

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.630
I'm a first year. First year, class 6, #15!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:17.180
See? You're the same age as me.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:20.770
And therefore we can conclude...

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.510
I am not your older brother!

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.240
Well, uh...

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:30.260
But I really do look up 
to your strength, Oga-san!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.210
You're already legendary among delinquents!

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.540
You're the strongest first year ever! 
The top of the notorious Ishiyama High!

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.570
I want to become stronger 
just like you, Oga-san!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.530
It is only natural that I call 
you Brother out of respect!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.030
No, I beg you for the privilege!

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.040
Ah, I suppose if you insist...

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.800
So in the end you brought him with you.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.120
I'm going say this straight. 
Are you an idiot?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.150
I no idiot. I honorary brother!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.530
Honorary brother idiot!

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.300
Those words go together not!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.300
Look he ain't Kanzaki or Himekawa... 
Your sworn little brother?

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.600
You're Furuichi-san, yes?

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.060
Y-Yes, and...?

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.670
Amazing! The rumors are true!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:22.900
Rumors?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.210
Oga-san's one faithful companion... 
The only man who can talk back to him!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.570
Furuichi the Strategist!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.720
Handsome and with a sharp mind!

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.070
You're super cool!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.350
He's a great guy!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.830
See?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.390
Oh? So you're Oga-san's sworn little brother?

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:48.940
Good for you, Kazu-kun!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.680
Yeah, guess so!

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.120
But the difficult part begins now.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:57.300
Just being his sworn little brother 
isn't going to make me stronger.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.100
From now on, it's harsh training every day!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.570
My goal is definitely that special attack...

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.650
...the 800 volt shock!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.690
But wait, Kazu-kun... Why do 
you want to get so strong?

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:17.310
Huh? Cause being a guy, you 
gotta be strong, right?

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:20.650
Travel the world using only your 
fists, and stuff like that.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:24.900
Now look here, Kazu-kun. There's 
all different kinds of strength.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:28.170
That's what last week's Gohan-kun anime said!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:33.180
Strength is love! And sometimes croquettes!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.630
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.500
Crap, I don't have time for this!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.880
I gotta go see my brother!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.140
Strength really is croquettes?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:57.620
Now that I think about it, wasn't Mito 
Mitsukuni the first Japanese to eat a croquette?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.380
Also know as Mito Koumon.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:04.860
<b>Mito Koumon was a Vice-Shogun during the Edo Period</b>

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:05.090
Perhaps there really is a mysterious power in 
croquettes that makes people grovel before you...

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:09.900
Or wait... Wasn't it ramen that he ate?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.220
Um, are you okay over there?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.580
I'm sorry!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:19.480
In order to become strong like you, Brother, 
I thought I should mimic exactly what you do!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.730
They say, "learn by doing", yes?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.020
Learn by pooing?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.230
No... by doing!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.490
Whatever, just let me eat in peace!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.240
O-Oga...

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:40.110
C-Could you...

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.830
...go out with me.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.290
The Queen asked Oga out!

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.630
Her confession of love is finally here!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.910
Madame, you mustn't be too hasty!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.890
Is everyone here in elementary school?!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.740
T-That's not what I meant!

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.400
I've been summoned by the guidance counselor.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.900
And so have you!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.020
Hey!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.170
Pardon us.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.980
I am Kido, the guidance counselor.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:25.040
I suspect you know why I've 
called you here today.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:32.800
No, not you.

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:39.560
I was afraid of this. The second you 
transferred in, we have a violent incident.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:44.060
I hear that you two did a real number 
on some students from Teimo Tech.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.880
But they were the ones that...

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.650
It would be trivial to expel you.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:53.070
But then there would be no 
reason for you to be here now.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:10:00.920
And there it is. I have heard you are like 
Ishiyama's leaders or something, yes?

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.830
What do you mean?

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:10.570
I call it... The Ishiyama 
Reformation Project.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.240
Listening in on people isn't right!

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.340
Azusa?

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:21.850
Or are you re-enacting a scene 
from "Ms. Maid saw you"?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.340
This maid shall tell you before you perish!

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:27.610
I've seen through everything 
you people are plotting!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.880
B-Be quiet.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:39.960
In other words, it's our job 
to keep everyone in line.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:41.860
It is?

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:46.990
I don't like that guy, threatening 
us with expulsion...

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.390
It's like Oga and I are on 
the Student Council together!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:53.710
After school, the two of us in the 
classroom writing the daily journal...

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.880
Just the two of us making the 
rounds in the school building!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.650
N-No! T-That's not what I intend...

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:03.060
Man, what a pain.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.840
Well, I'll let you handle the rest!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.150
What are you saying? Hold it!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.690
This sucks...

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.650
You're the one from yesterday.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.750
Thank you for saving me yesterday.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.660
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.550
Thank you for always assisting my brother!

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:31.660
I apologize for not introducing 
myself. I am Yamamura Kazuya.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.560
Please call me Kazu.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.580
This is my childhood 
friend, Fujisaki Azusa...

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:40.250
Not again... Aren't you embarrassed 
saying "childhood friend" at this point?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.340
It's fine, jeez!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.490
Anyway, we have to get back 
or lunch break will be over!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:50.380
You've got day duty today, right?

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:54.940
How can she do it? How can I talk 
to a boy all cute like that?

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:58.790
I've never had anyone like 
her around me before...

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:04.700
I might be able to learn something from her!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.370
Hey. You got a minute?

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:34.770
Count Poo, today you aren't getting away!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:35.750
Impertinent fool!

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.020
You seriously think some 
white rice can defeat <i>me</i>?

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.030
Stop it, the both of you!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.450
Brother, what shall I do next?

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.330
Uh, that's enough. You're damn loud.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.510
Don't be like that!

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.540
Oh! Why don't I take care of the little guy?

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.830
Seems like he don't want 
you taking care of him.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:13:00.500
I see... Then, how about 
I help make dinner, Ma'am?

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.820
Let's make croquettes!

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.480
Enough! Go home already.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.750
You're a pest.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:10.310
What is so wrong with it? He's 
your sworn little brother, yes?

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:12.930
Who are you?

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.850
You're my brother's father, yes?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.340
It is a pleasure to meet you!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.530
Brother?

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.860
Tatsumi's little brother?!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.030
When did this happen?!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.950
WHO IS THE FATHER?!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:33.660
Oh? So this is where you live, Senpai?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.460
Sorry for asking you out here like this...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.520
Naw... Kazu-kun's over 
at Oga-san's house, so...

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:41.460
Do you always walk home together?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.460
It's not "always", but...

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.470
He lives in the 
neighborhood, you know?

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:49.230
Oh, right... He did say you 
were childhood friends.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:53.200
No! This isn't what I 
called her to talk about!

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.670
I need to ask her how she can talk with 
boys in such a naturally cute manner!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.480
I've got to learn this from her...

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.700
So anyway, are you two 
like... d-d-dating, right?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.880
Um... Could it be that you...

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.280
...have a crush on Kazu-kun?

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:19.800
N-N-No! I...

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.400
Yeah... I figured it couldn't be that.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.460
You've got Oga-san, after all.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:34.180
I know! Since I'm here and all, 
I'll say a prayer for Kazu-kun!

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.940
I pray that Kazu-kun gets stronger.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:46.390
It's no use... She's a natural air-head...

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:49.450
No learning from her. I'll 
never be able to act like that.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.440
Matching lunches?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.940
So that's how it is with you two!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.880
You okay with this, Furuichi?

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.190
You really <i>are</i> like elementary schoolers...

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:15.060
Brother's mom taught me the 
menu, and I made it myself!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.060
Kazu... Isn't it about 
time to give it a rest?

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.530
But I want to become stronger!

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.840
Just like you!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:25.570
If I can't learn by imitating, 
then please teach me how to train!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.670
Train me to unleash that special lightning attack!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:29.570
Train me!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:33.840
Okay, got it! Meet me behind 
the gymnasium after school.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.330
I'll train you!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.990
You will?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.500
Oh, jeez, Oga...

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.800
Azusa, you're alone today?

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.760
Yeah. Kazu-kun's got some 
kind of training, he said.

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:07.150
Now, cross your arms and yell out, "Jowa!"

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:08.760
Jowa!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.400
Damn, that was close. 
Put more spirit into it.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:13.910
Jowa!

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.660
Maybe your arms are at 
a slightly wrong angle?

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:20.160
Are you sure about this, Oga?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:25.010
Pretty soon Baby Beel'll 
get hungry and peeved...

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:26.170
And when that happens...

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:27.890
Jowa!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.170
Wait... You don't mean...

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:33.930
Jowa!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.930
Now, put more energy into it!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.940
Jowa!!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:55.950
All right! I finally learned 
the secret shock attack!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.610
Yes, excellent work!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.970
I have now taught you everything I know!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.250
Kazu!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.970
We've got trouble!

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:27.160
Fujisaki's been carried off by a
rugged-looking man with a shaved head!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.470
Shaved head?

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:35.370
Don't tell me... Those Teimo 
bastards are back for revenge?!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.980
Hey, what'll we do?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.120
W-What'll we do? Uh...

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.030
I have to save her...

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:47.500
But alone? Should I ask my brother to help?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:51.090
It would be simple to expel you two...

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:56.160
If I get him wrapped up in this, 
he'll be expelled this time!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.430
Hey, Kazu...!

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.570
There's only one thing to 
do! I'm going to rescue her!

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.980
I can handle this all by myself.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:09.600
Huh?

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:32.540
It'll be okay. Now I have 
that special attack!

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.550
Get away from Azusa!

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.590
Kazu-kun?

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:09.670
Jowa!!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.060
C-Crap...

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.560
Hey, Oga...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.070
Just watch.

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:47.870
I can't turn-tail now... 
I have to save Azusa!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.970
Azusa, run for it!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.590
Kazu-kun?

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.810
Kazu-kun, are you feeling all right?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.310
What a pain.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.940
Don't do it, Brother!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.210
This... I will handle...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.920
By myself...

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.780
I have to do this alone!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.150
I'll beat this guy!

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:33.000
Hey, pipe down out here!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.400
What the hell are you doing?

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.750
Don't come too close! This guy is...

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:40.180
He's an acquaintance of 
my grandfather, and...?

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:41.750
As I figured...

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.260
Huh? What was that?

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.610
You know him?

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.200
This is where you live?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.730
Uosu!

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:53.780
During my training, I found this giant 
wild potato and brought it here, uosu!

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.220
Uh, thanks...

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.730
And can you speak more quietly?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.980
You'll disturb the neighbors.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:58.770
Uoisu!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:20:59.780
That's what I mean!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:01.280
O-Oga?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.330
What? What's going on?!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.280
Actually I got lost!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.070
This girl showed me here!

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:09.790
Uoisu!

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.140
Hand the potato over.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:11.790
Sure.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.260
Shut up!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.290
Aza~su!

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:24.050
Sorry about the misunderstanding.

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:26.730
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:30.560
But I guess her shrine 
didn't grant my prayer.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.060
That was so uncool...

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.150
Oh, yeah? You might not 
have gotten stronger...

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.060
but you were really cool, Kazu-kun!

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:15.600
Wow! Who knew this shrine 
would be the Queen's home?

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.040
Maybe I'll come and pray here every day!

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.500
Whatever!

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:21.540
Now then, if you'll excuse me!

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:27.230
That chrome-top's got one hell of a 
nasty look to him, that's for sure.

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:31.250
My grandfather isn't your 
normal person either, so...

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:32.930
By the way, Madame,

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.980
you have become quite pretty 
since I saw you last!

00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:36.740
And I hear you have a boyfriend?

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:39.510
T-That's not true! It's not like that!

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:44.960
The young lady~ has got a boyfriend~

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:44.960
Stop it!

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:46.880
Shut up already!

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:48.180
What the heck?

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:05.340
This is huge, Oga! Angelica-san 
is coming to the Human World!

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:07.250
Angelica-san? Who was that again?

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:08.940
Alaindelon's daughter!

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:10.300
Why is she coming here?

00:24:10.580 --> 00:24:13.960
Could it be she's going to live 
in my house instead of Alaindelon?

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:15.780
Yople. Yopalelimen.

00:24:15.780 --> 00:24:18.710
And the shocking return of the Yople Aliens?!

00:24:18.710 --> 00:24:20.180
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:21.980
Called a Magical Girl!

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:25.900
Plus Hilda-san and Kunieda-senpai 
transform into magical girls?

00:24:25.900 --> 00:24:27.980
I have no clue what the 
plot is going to be about.
